# Background: (v0.2) names conditions shared by every element of the screen. They are
# established after the screen is opened, in order, before the condition of each block.
Screen: User Details
  Background: The user is logged in
  Background: The user has a profile picture

  Element: Page Header
    Show: Avatar
    And: Logout link

  Element: Edit Button
    When: Viewing your own profile
    Enable

    When: Viewing another user's profile
    Disable

Screen: Login

  Element: Login Form
    Show: Email address
